h/ssh.go:210-216` logs submitted SSH passwords and keyboard-interactive responses; `Connect` logs the plaintext password and its derived hash at lines 787 and 796-812.\n- `pkgs/identity/web/web.go:135` registers `/set-cookie`; its handler reads a JWT at lines 401-410 and logs the token, parsed token, connection, and token/cookie again at lines 408, 416, 430, and 441.\n\nAnyone with access to the service journal or log collection can recover credentials or replay tokens from these entries. Keep useful authentication observability, but emit only non-secret metadata.\n\n## Required behavior\n\nNever log plaintext passwords, password-derived authentication material, JWTs/cookies, or structured objects that contain them. Replace them with safe metadata such as authentication method, outcome, and non-sensitive identifiers.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Capture logs while exercising SSH password auth, keyboard-interactive auth, and `/set-cookie` with a valid JWT; assert each injected sentinel credential is absent from all emitted log records.\n- Retain useful non-secret outcome/method logs for success and failure paths.\n- Include invalid-token/error-path coverage so errors do not echo the submitted credential.","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com